WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:10.480
In fewer than two decades, the Spider-Man
franchise has already amassed a history

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:14.250
of stops and restarts. But the most surprising
were the sudden cancellations of

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:18.560
Amazing Spider-Man 3 and the spin-offs planned
to follow. It was confusing and

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.370
strange, but there's an interesting story
behind why the sequel to a successful movie

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:24.570
got tossed in the garbage.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:26.340
THE PLANNED SEQUELS

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:30.500
Sony's plans for Amazing Spider-Man 3 and
4 were pretty crazy. The plan involved

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.300
not only resurrections for both Gwen Stacy
and her father, but also Gwen becoming

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.489
something like the Spider-Gwen character who
has since debuted in the comics in

00:00:37.489 --> 00:00:41.859
2015. (For those not familiar with the comics,
"Spider-Gwen" is basically, "Gwen

00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:45.920
Stacy, but with the powers of Spider-Man.
And is from another dimension.") To add

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:51.219
to that, Sony also planned some villain-centric
films as well: Sinister Six and Venom.

00:00:51.219 --> 00:00:54.440
The ideas were all intriguing. But then, seemingly
overnight, those plans got

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:56.989
THE PLANS GET CANCELLED

00:00:56.989 --> 00:01:00.920
Amazing Spider-Man 3 and 4 were both planned
and even had release dates set for

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:05.390
2016 and 2018. Paul Giamatti also confirmed
that he'd return as the Rhino for the

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:10.210
third movie. But then the movies began to
get delayed. Also, Marc Webb, a huge part

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:14.280
of the first two films success, stated that
he'd only return to direct the third film

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:14.409
and

00:01:14.409 --> 00:01:18.920
only act as consultant for the fourth, which
wasn't a good sign. Ultimately, all of the

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:20.189
planned movies got cancelled.

00:01:20.189 --> 00:01:21.759
GARFIELD GOT HIMSELF FIRED

00:01:21.759 --> 00:01:26.250
Andrew Garfield helped pave the way for this
new direction for Spider-Man. It's also

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:30.409
the actual reason plans for Amazing Spider-Man
3 got canceled. Garfield was

00:01:30.409 --> 00:01:34.719
supposed to attend a gala after the 2014 World
Cup in Brazil, where he'd have been

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:38.619
announced as the star of Amazing Spider-Man
3 by Sony bigwig Kaz Hirai, but

00:01:38.619 --> 00:01:42.539
Garfield cancelled at the last minute. Garfield
most likely cancelled due to feeling

00:01:42.539 --> 00:01:46.320
under the weather from the long flight there,
which is understandable. But still,

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:50.740
Hirai felt slighted. Execs felt that it was
a slight against the company as well. So

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:54.259
Garfield was out. A man lost a job because
someone's feelings got hurt. That's

00:01:54.259 --> 00:01:54.520
professionalism!

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:58.109
THE SONY HACKS AND THE NEW DIRECTION

00:01:58.109 --> 00:02:02.329
The Sony hacks from late-2014 revealed a lot
about the sudden changes with their

00:02:02.329 --> 00:02:05.479
Spider-Man franchise. According to the leaked
emails, the lukewarm reviews it

00:02:05.479 --> 00:02:09.110
received were enough to spur Sony into taking
the character in another direction. It

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:13.080
involved the hiring of another actor to play
the role of Peter Parker, Tom Holland -

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:17.250
the youngest actor to take the role so far,
suggested a desire to keep Parker young.

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:19.980
But this wasn't the only big news to come
from the hacks…

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:21.760
JOINING THE MARVEL CINEMATIC UNIVERSE

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:24.800
Sony worked out a deal with Marvel to bring
Spider-Man into Marvel's cinematic

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:29.590
universe. Fanboys and fangirls around the
world squealed in delight. Since then, it's

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:32.900
been revealed that Spidey would make his debut
in a big way, as part of Captain

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:36.460
America: Civil War. This puts Spidey in line
to participate in Marvel's climactic

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:40.380
Avengers: Infinity War movies, something a
lot of fans, want to see.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:54.720
Thanks for watching, and don't forget to like and subscribe if you want more.

